          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሮ ፡ ናቸውና፡ ኆፃ፡ ይቡስ ፡ ነው ፡ ይቡ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳነ ፡ አእምሮ ፡ ናቸውና ፡ ኆፃ ፡ ክቡድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ ክቡዳነ ፡ አእምሮ ፡ ናቸውና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኆፃ ፡ ምድራዊ ፡ ነው ፡ ምድራዊ ፡ ሥራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሠራሉና ፡ ጻድቃን ፡ ልጆቹን ፡ በኮከብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መስሎ ፡ ተናገረ ፡ ኮከብ ፡ ብሩህ ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሩሃነ ፡ አእምሮ ፡ ናቸውና ፡ ኮከብ ፡ ሰማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያዊ ፡ ነው ፡ ሰማያዊ ፡ ሥራ ፡ ይሠራሉና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኮከብ፡በብርሃን፡ይበላለጣል፡ (ጥቅ)፡ኮከብ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እምኮከብ ፡ ይኄይስ ፡ ክብሩ ፡ እንዲል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጻድቃንም ፡ በክብር ፡ ይበላለጣሉና ። በባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕርይ ፡ ብቻ ፡ የሚወልዳቸው ፡ ልጆቹን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኆፃ ፡ መስሎ ፡ በባሕርይም ፡ በግብርም፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚወልዳቸውን ፡ በኮከብ ፡ መስሎ ፡ ተና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገረ ። ሦስተኛም ፡ አብርሃም ፡ ላምስቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
